# Features Promotion Threshold

Default to `components/<domain>` and escalate to `features/<domain>` only when needed.

## Rule

- Start with `frontend/app/components/<domain>/` for shared presentational modules.
- Promote to `frontend/app/features/<domain>/` only with explicit behavioral complexity:
  - state orchestration across multiple surfaces
  - server actions or domain workflows
  - cross-cutting hooks/services used by multiple routes
- Document the reason for promotion in the PR/plan notes.

## Anti-Pattern

- Creating a `features/` module for purely presentational reuse with no workflow/state complexity.
